<title>POLAND: EFEKT OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 87,800.</title>
<headline>EFEKT OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 87,800.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.09 vs   0.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.16 vs   0.26</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.16 vs   0.12</p>
<p> Sales		    1.72 vs   1.14</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.63 vs   2.94</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.82 vs   4.84</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.02 vs   1.33</p>
<p> Sales		   14.94 vs  11.52</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish trading firm is Korporacja</p>
<p>Gospodarcza Efekt SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
